# Appendable class infrastructure: AppendableSeq instance with string elements.
# Verifies that concat on Seq of strings works correctly.
# Note: builtin-concat Appendable constraint for Seq[T] is tracked in TODO.md.
[result: [collect [concat [seq "a" [builtin-variant "Seq.Nil"]] [seq "b" [builtin-variant "Seq.Nil"]]]]]
=== out
Dict({"result": Dict({0: String("a"), 1: String("b")})})
